# SDD progress ledger scratch

# KB session state. The four role files ARE source of truth -- CLAUDE.md 14.5
# rule 3 calls them "the ONLY mutable state per role" and the handoff skills
# commit them. They were tracked while also being ignored, so a NEW role's
# state file could not be added without `git add -f`. Ignore scratch state,
# negate the real ones.
kb/sessions/*.state.json
!kb/sessions/planning.state.json
!kb/sessions/dev-sqe.state.json
!kb/sessions/pre-pr.state.json
!kb/sessions/phase-6.state.json

# Merge and patch leftovers — committable today, which is how a .orig file
# ends up in a review.
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local test output directory (only test_results.txt was covered)
test_results/

# Locally-fetched pinned tooling (make gitleaks-install). Binary, version-pinned
# in the Makefile, never committed.
.tools/

# LLM eval-harness output (scripts/run_llm_eval.py / make eval-llm)
eval_results/
release-staging*/
dataset-export/

# Per-package coverage report produced by CI's cloud floor check
coverage-cloud.json
